Third-party material
--------------------

tests/fixtures/data/bc-en.yaml is cut down from the bc-en.yaml dataset of
battle-cats-rolls by godfat (https://gitlab.com/godfat/battle-cats-rolls),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The pages under tests/fixtures/*.html
were saved from bc.godfat.org, the same project's site. bcgacha downloads the
full dataset at run time; it does not ship it.

tests/fixtures/data/tiers.json maps cat ids to the tiers of the community
tier list at https://www.battlecatstierlist.com, cut down to those two facts.

